license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
abstract: >
  Code and data compendium containing all data, R scripts, and analysis for the study
  of the spatial distribution of tumular and megalithic monuments in the Serra do
  Laboreiro region (NW Iberian Peninsula), using landscape archaeology and spatial
  statistics.
keywords:
  - landscape archaeology
  - spatial statistics
  - megalithic monuments
  - GIS
  - R
  - point process models
  - NW Iberian Peninsula
